# Community Event
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Community — an event hosted by a Group
# Case 12 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: community-group.menata
#
# Note: RSVP (who is attending) is deliberately NOT written as its own Machine
# here — it would be a fourth instance of the same many-to-many join shape
# already proven twice in Case 11 (Follow, Like) and once above (Membership).
# Composable from CAP-F20 without new design effort.

Event

Fields

- Group : Group
- Title : Text
- Description : Rich Text
- Start Date Time : Date Time
- Location : Text

Constraints

- Group is required.
- Title is required.
- Start Date Time is required.

Permissions

Admin

- Create Event

Views

- Event Form : Form
- Upcoming Events : List
- Event Detail : Detail
